<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Game downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Game downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Friday it downgraded to neutral from a buy its recommendation of International Game Technology Inc based on a shrinking domestic market and slower than expected expansion of the international market for its gaming machines.</p>
<p>Shares of International Game were trading up 3/8 to 17.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
